  },
  data: {
    LLM: "1. Starting to the left of the dealer, each player makes a bet against the current pot.\n2. **Betting**: You must bet at least the ante and may bet up to the total amount in the pot.\n3. **The Reveal**: Once the bet is placed, the dealer 'burns' one card and then reveals the next card from the deck.\n4. **Outcome**: - If you have a card of the SAME suit and HIGHER rank than the revealed card, you WIN and take your stake + an equal amount from the pot. - If you do NOT have a card of that suit or your cards of that suit are LOWER, you LOSE and your stake is added to the pot.",
    Player: "1. Starting to the left of the dealer, each player makes a bet against the current pot.\n2. **Betting**: You must bet at least the ante and may bet up to the total amount in the pot.\n3. **The Reveal**: Once the bet is placed, the dealer 'burns' one card and then reveals the next card from the deck.\n4. **Outcome**: - If you have a card of the SAME suit and HIGHER rank than the revealed card, you WIN and take your stake + an equal amount from the pot. - If you do NOT have a card of that suit or your cards of that suit are LOWER, you LOSE and your stake is added to the pot.",
    objective: 'Win the pot by having a card in your hand that is the same suit as and higher in rank than a card dealt from the remaining deck.',
    gameplay: "1. Starting to the left of the dealer, each player makes a bet against the current pot.\n2. **Betting**: You must bet at least the ante and may bet up to the total amount in the pot.\n3. **The Reveal**: Once the bet is placed, the dealer 'burns' one card and then reveals the next card from the deck.\n4. **Outcome**: - If you have a card of the SAME suit and HIGHER rank than the revealed card, you WIN and take your stake + an equal amount from the pot. - If you do NOT have a card of that suit or your cards of that suit are LOWER, you LOSE and your stake is added to the pot.",
